---
kind: scene
id: spine.champion
title: The Champion
on: challenge
target: arena.championHall
once: false
when: "count('beatElite', ['_']) >= 4 && !@champion"
---

## The hall

::bg{location="champion-hall" time="day"}
::music{action="change" mood="tense" volume="normal"}
@narrator{code="0010"}: The last door opens on a hall of white stone. Someone is already standing on the Champion's dais.
::auto{character="rival" anchor="right" action="enter"}
<match on="run.rivalStanding">
  <when is="1..">
    @rival{code="0010" emotion="determined"}: Hey. I beat the Four an hour before you did, so I'm the Champion. You've beaten me more times than I like to count. Not today.
  </when>
  <when is="..-1">
    @rival{code="0020" emotion="smug"}: Hey! I knew you'd make it. I beat the Four before you, which makes me the Champion. Like every other time we've battled, I'm going to win.
  </when>
  <otherwise>
    @rival{code="0030"}: Hey. I beat the Four first, so I'm the Champion. We're even, you and me. Let's settle it.
  </otherwise>
</match>
@rival{code="0040"}: Since Gramps gave us our monsters I've been everywhere. Every route, every cave, every tower. I'm the best there is!
::use{component="rivalBattle" meet="champion" kind="champion" intro="Do you know what that means? It means you're facing the Champion!" win="NO! That can't be! You beat my best! After all that work, my reign is over already." lose="Hahaha! I'm the Champion! Get used to it!" instance="use-001"}
<match on="scene.battle.fight.won">
  <when is="true">
    ::auto{character="profAlder" anchor="left" action="enter"}
    @profAlder{code="0010" emotion="happy"}: {{userName}}! You did it. You beat Kai, and the Four, and all of Verdane's leaders.
    @profAlder{code="0020" emotion="worried"}: Kai. You lost because you forgot to love your monsters. Think about that.
    @profAlder{code="0030"}: {{userName}}, come with me. The Hall of Fame is waiting.
  </when>
  <otherwise>
    @narrator{code="0020"}: The Champion's hall goes quiet. The League sends challengers back to the start.
    ::retract{defeated(frostine)}
    ::retract{defeated(tarrok)}
    ::retract{defeated(morwen)}
    ::retract{defeated(drakon)}
  </otherwise>
</match>
